                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b0d3ece0-0bba-4de7-92d3-e4b3e4021128",
                                "sense_id": "be472ef1-ce5d-310a-b8b1-ca42211e24da",
                                "text": "На друго́й день у́тром, по́сле бессо́нной но́чи, Авде́ев, как всегда́, отпра́вился к себе́ в ла́вку. Покупа́тели принесли́ ему́ изве́стие, что в истёкшую ночь прокуро́р отпра́вил в тюрьму́ ещё това́рища дире́ктора и письмоводи́теля ба́нка.",
                                "translation": "Next morning after a sleepless night Avdeyev, as usual, went to his shop. His customers brought him the news that during the night the public prosecutor had sent the deputy manager and the head-clerk to prison as well.",
                                "english": "Next morning after a sleepless night Avdeyev, as usual, went to his shop. His customers brought him the news that during the night the public prosecutor had sent the deputy manager and the head-clerk to prison as well."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
